OL,3,AFour murder arrests after teenagers
OL,4,Aattacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are continuing to investigate
OL,7,Ffollowing the arrests of four people
OL,8,Fafter a man died and another suffered
OL,9,Flife-threatening injuries in
OL,10,FStoke-on-Trent.
OL,12,FA cordon remains in place on Brookhouse
OL,13,FRoad, Meir, after police were called to
OL,14,Freports of violence at 23:45 BST on
OL,15,FFriday.
OL,17,FA man in his late teens was confirmed
OL,18,Fdead at the scene, Staffordshire Police
OL,19,Fsaid, and another man, also in his late
OL,20,Fteens, was taken to hospital, where he
OL,21,Fremains in a critical but stable
OL,22,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
