OL,3,AFour murder arrests after teenagers
OL,4,Aattacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo 18-year-old men, a 20-year-old man
OL,7,Fand a 17-year-old boy, all from
OL,8,FStoke-on-Trent, were arrested on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of murder, while the boy was
OL,10,Falso arrested on suspicion of attempted
OL,11,Fmurder. All remain in police custody.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
